title: The Concordat
subtitle: An urgent card of the cabinet: the concordat with the Holy See waits for its decision.
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_politics_rules && PolishPolitics.concordatGovernmentActive(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card of the Government (Z — 1.05, the user's decisions of 7 XI 2026): from II to III 1925 while PPS sits in the cabinet; the
// cabinet accepts or rejects the concordat without a vote, as every decision of a ministry; it costs no action.
PolishPolitics.concordatView(Q);
!}

= The concordat

The talks with the Holy See are over. The concordat would make Catholic instruction compulsory in public schools, and the clergy would swear an oath of loyalty to the state; the decision belongs to the cabinet.

- @accept
- @reject
- @later

@accept
title: Accept the concordat
subtitle: [? if pl_conc_catholic : The Catholic partners in the cabinet are pleased, but ?][? if not pl_conc_catholic : No partner in the cabinet objects, but ?] the Left of the party protests (+8).
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_conc_result = PolishPolitics.concordatChoose(Q, 'accept');
!}
go-to: result

@reject
title: Reject the concordat
subtitle: The Left of the party is with us, [? if pl_conc_catholic : but the Catholic partners in the cabinet are outraged (+20). ?][? if not pl_conc_catholic : but we lose among Catholic voters in the countryside. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_conc_result = PolishPolitics.concordatChoose(Q, 'reject');
!}
go-to: result

@later
title: Not now
subtitle: The card stays in the hand until the end of March.
go-to: root

@result
new-page: true

= The concordat

[+ pl_conc_result +]

- @root: Continue.
